   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Juvenile Justice UNICEF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Juvenile Justice UNICEF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att genom Unicefs arbete med lokala            institutioner f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra lagstiftning, system och kapacitet att        hantera, skydda och rehabiitera barn och ungdomar som kommer i        kontakt med kriminalitet. St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r kopplat till Bosnien &amp;            Herzegovinas reformprogram f&#xf6;r ungdomar och r&#xe4;ttivsa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Juvenile Justice Reform and strengthen justice for     children in line with international standards. The Swedish            contribution is channelled through Unicef and the 3-year project will support legislative changes, crime prevention and improve systems and capacities in social and judicial authorities to respond to children  and youth offenders and victims.</narrative>
  </description>
